holyc (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * HolyC compiler written in Go
  * Supports lexical analysis, parsing, and x64 code generation
  * Command-line interface with tokenize and parse modes
  * Compiles HolyC source code to binary executables

